	(text "BASE v1.3.0 POWER UPGRADE - see POWER.md\nF1/D2 protect VBUS at the USB-C input; 5V_SYS is tapped from protected VBUS (after F1, before FB1) through F2, D3 and 100uF/0.1uF bulk.\n12 x per-slot 2:1 power mux (U6..U17): shunt fitted -> 5V_SYS, open/lost -> +3.3V (100k pulldown). J7..J18 sit hidden under a mated module: place them over the slot power rail, not in the ground/power gap. Protection hierarchy: F1 = 2A hold (input), F2 = 1.1A hold (5V branch), U5 own internal limit (3.3V branch). Per-slot current limit = 667mA nominal (R28..R51 = 750R)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 280.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "55479a8a-0cd8-5219-a20f-6ec4e1e11d03")
	)
